---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How I think about clear, practical notes"
  description="A small personal system for learning, saving, and acting without getting lost in research loops."
>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <h1>Clear notes, not research loops.</h1>
        <p>This site is a working notebook for a simple idea: if it is not practical, it is not finished yet.</p>
        <p>I share short how-to notes with real steps, real caveats, and just enough background to avoid wasted searching later.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="/guide/" class="btn-primary">Start with the guide</a>
          <a href="/about/" class="btn-secondary">About this project</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-media">
        <div class="hero-image">
          <img src="/hero-placeholder.svg" alt="Editorial hero illustration" width="640" height="420" loading="eager" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>How I work</h2>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="card card-raised card-interactive">
        <p style="font-weight:700">Stop browsing</p>
        <p style="color:var(--color-ink-muted);margin-top:0.35rem">First pass: search terms, site: filters, saved tab groups. After 20 minutes, stop even if nothing feels "enough."</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-raised card-interactive">
        <p style="font-weight:700">Open three sources</p>
        <p style="color:var(--color-ink-muted);margin-top:0.35rem">One overview, one practitioner explainer, one primary source or official guidance. That is usually enough.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-raised card-interactive">
        <p style="font-weight:700">Write it in your words</p>
        <p style="color:var(--color-ink-muted);margin-top:0.35rem">One paragraph. One step you would actually do. If you cannot explain the action, you do not have a how-to yet.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-raised card-interactive">
        <p style="font-weight:700">Check before saving</p>
        <p style="color:var(--color-ink-muted);margin-top:0.35rem">One fact check, one source link, one date. If it feels urgent, slow down; urgency is usually noise.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Recent notes</h2>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <a href="/guide/" class="card card-interactive" style="display:block;text-decoration:none">
        <div class="card-image">
          <img src="/note-placeholder-1.svg" alt="Note thumbnail" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <p style="font-weight:600;color:var(--color-ink)">A fast checklist for noisy mornings</p>
        <span style="display:block;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-ink-muted);margin-top:0.35rem">Updated recently</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/guide/" class="card card-interactive" style="display:block;text-decoration:none">
        <div class="card-image">
          <img src="/note-placeholder-2.svg" alt="Note thumbnail" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <p style="font-weight:600;color:var(--color-ink)">How I stopped repeating searches for the same topic</p>
        <span style="display:block;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-ink-muted);margin-top:0.35rem">Updated recently</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/guide/" class="card card-interactive" style="display:block;text-decoration:none">
        <div class="card-image">
          <img src="/note-placeholder-3.svg" alt="Note thumbnail" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <p style="font-weight:600;color:var(--color-ink)">Writing notes you will actually reread</p>
        <span style="display:block;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-ink-muted);margin-top:0.35rem">Updated recently</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section callout">
    <p style="color:var(--color-ink);margin:0">Start with the guide if you want one concrete workflow instead of philosophy.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:0.6rem">
      <a href="/guide/" style="font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px">Open the guide -></a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <style>
    .section + .section {
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }
    .hero {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      align-items: center;
    }
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .hero {
        grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      }
    }
    .hero-copy h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.05;
      color: var(--color-navy);
      margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    }
    .hero-copy p {
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
      margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    }
    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
    }
    .hero-media {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .hero-image {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 640px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-elevated);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(13,125,113,0.18), rgba(15,23,42,0.18));
      position: relative;
    }
    .hero-image::before {
      content: "";
      display: block;
      padding-top: 66%;
    }
    .hero-image img {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }
    .card-image {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(13,125,113,0.14), rgba(15,23,42,0.10));
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }
    .card-image::before {
      content: "";
      display: block;
      padding-top: 56.25%;
    }
    .card-image img {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }
    .grid-3 .card {
      display: block;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
